Add GpuRoceTransceiver::get_tx_ring_lkey().

The unified GPU dispatch path posts its own sends from the TX ring, which needs
the TX ring memory region's local key in the send WQE. GpuRoceTransceiver
registers that region but only exposes get_rkey(), the RX ring's key.

Upstream: https://gitlab-master.nvidia.com/holoscan/hololink/-/merge_requests/1170
Generated against holoscan-sensor-bridge 2.6.0-EA2. Delete this patch once the
CUDAQ_REALTIME_HSB_REF pinned in realtime/scripts/deps_common.sh contains it.

